expression: info.instructions.clone().unwrap_or_default()
---
devlanes runs a dev environment per Git worktree (a lane) with its own ports, URLs and env. Call the devlanes_read tool with the command line after "devlanes" as args. This server only reads: ask the user to start, stop or change anything.
- wait blocks until ready or failed: no sleep or curl polling.

More:
- Read a unit with `devlanes logs web --tail 100`, the lane with `devlanes status`, a failure with `devlanes debug why web`.
- cwd picks the worktree; without it the call uses the project the agent runs in.
